msgid "Description"
msgstr "Описание"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/flippo.rst:43
msgid ""
"This effect/filter flips the input video along the X and/or Y axis. It "
"basically combines the :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"transform_distort_perspective/flip_horizontally` and :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/"
"flip_vertically` effects. Also compare with :doc:`/effects_and_filters/"
"video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/mirror`."
msgstr ""
"Этот эффект/фильтр отражает входное видео по оси X и/или Y. По сути он "
"объединяет эффекты :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"transform_distort_perspective/flip_horizontally` и :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/"
"flip_vertically`. Сравните также с :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"transform_distort_perspective/mirror`."

